lass=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/50494840/fb28ad59d93907a87f1364f8792d2dae_8409133885849022684.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">231</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">9</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">崩坏世界的歌姬钟情的打碟机，复数的黑胶唱片在优秀的DJ手下能混奏出有如流星般动感的音乐。当然，没有什么能难倒布洛妮娅和她的助理重装小兔——就连把打碟机改造成粒子炮这样的小事也是。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">流星强音</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">使用光束对直线目标造成持续伤害，持续攻击会过热。距离光束核心越近伤害越高，小于10米时达到最大伤害。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:11][冷却:20秒]主动使用使场上所有闪耀之星发出强烈的闪光，每个闪耀之星对周围敌人造成200%攻击力的物理伤害并使敌人进入脆弱状态，防御力降低30%，持续4.0秒。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【舞台】闪耀之星被拾取时，提高所有场上角色10%攻击速度，持续5秒，该效果唯一生效不可叠加</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">闪耀之星</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色在场上时，每3秒在周围生成存在4.5秒的闪耀之星。角色拾取闪耀之星时，对附近随机敌人及其周围敌人造成200%攻击力的物理伤害</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取方式</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">活动获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">参与2018年音乐节「热夜之梦」活动获得</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">参与爱酱两周岁活动玩法获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">时空胶囊</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">消耗 星石×5000 兑换获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">材料-活动</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">开启「音乐武器自选箱」兑换获得</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22stigmata%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2225%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A1%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A1%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22level%22%3A%2230%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A1%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A1%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22level%22%3A%2235%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A1%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A2%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22level%22%3A%2240%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%